Z||000002||BENGAL4||08-15-2001||10:23 PM||||Count,<P>Dont let the talk of the low class crowd on the Forum, stop you from coming up to the cruise. Our circle of forum friends are not like that. I cherish the freindships I've made on this forum. Everyone, that I know is coming, are down home friendly.<P>We were at 2M4Dales last weekend, and I didn't even here the word rice or any other ethnic slur. There were 18 Fieros there. We are just friends who were sharing their love and knowledge of our beloved 2 seater. <P>There were coupe and fastback owners. Duke, Quad 4, 2.8, 3.4 and 3800 owners. Teenagers and a fellow in his 60's. Need I say more?<P>Bill<p>[This message has been edited by BENGAL4 (edited 08-15-2001).]||||reg||10
