Z||000020||1FST2M6||08-16-2001||11:56 AM||||vinyl=sticker,  the owner of the car is trying to copy the original Green bergenholtz 600hp Turbo CRX not REX the bh car was a 10 second car that turned into a show piece(built by JG Motorworks(Ca.) and Turbo Specialities(Al)). where the purple car above is a copy of a fast car with stickers trying to be like somthing/somone they are not. Cheese taillight covers, and double cheese wing  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> Dual exhaust, a Type R sticker? Honda never made a type R CRX... the engine swap isn't that difficult to get a Vtec head in but odds are it's not B18C5 Type R engine in it. <P> Guess i'm Porage cause i copied a Lotus Color...   ||||reg||1
Z||000021||Black88GT||08-16-2001||12:53 PM||||Sing it with me....<P>Yo, VTEC, lets kick it, Rice Rice Baby, Rice Rice Baby... <P>Alright stop collaborate and listen, Rice is back with a brand new invention. <BR>Chopped springs, they hug tha road tightly, 6 inch exhaust tip flows really loud nightly. Will it ever stop, yo, I don't know, hit my neon lights, and I'll glow. To tha extreme my car looks like a candle, and tha paint job - it was done by a vandal. Dance, I got a speaker that booms, this aint a car, it's a mobile sound room. Deadly, listen to tha melody, if it was louder yo, it'd be a felony. Love it or leave it you can't gain way, with my Type-R sticker I'll lose to you any day. If there was a problem yo I'll solve it, check out my rims while my front drive revolves it, <P>Rice Rice Baby, Rice Rice Baby... <P>Now that my suspension is jumpin', my bumper hits tha ground, but who cares I'm a thumpin. Quick to tha point, to tha point no fakin', cookin' Corvettes like a pound of bacon. Burning 'em, cause I'm quick and nimble, you can't fade me and my VTEC symbol, In your souped up 5.0... I'm on a roll, I always ride solo. Rollin', in my 2 point 0, it runs 18's, yo, that really ain't slow. Tha girlies on stand by, don't even want to say "Hi". Did ya stop? No, I just flew by. Kept on, pursuing to tha next block, I bust a left and I'm headin' to tha next stop. The block was dead, yo, so I continued to A-1-A, Detroit Avenue! Tha girls looked hot wearing less than bikinis, I saw a few chumps drivin' stock lamborghinis. Jealous, cause I'm out drivin' mine, ready to race 'cuz my Nittos lookin' fine. If there was a problem, yo I'll solve it, check out my rims while my front drive revolves it, <P>Rice Rice Baby, Rice Rice Baby... <P>Take heed, 'cause I'm a Honda poet, Akimoto's on tha scene just in <BR>case ya didn't know it. My exhaust tip, created all tha bass sound, rumbles <BR>enough to put holes in tha ground. 'Cause my ride's style is so reeeeeeeeeeeeal, with an exhaust tone that ya can feeeeeeeel. 4 foot spoiler, it's a helluva concept, my ride is hype, and you wanna step WITH THIS, In my rearview you'll fade, slice like a Ginsu -sounds like a Kitchen-Aid. So fast, that all tha V8's say "damn", if rice was a drug I'd sell it by tha gram. Keep my composure when the front tire breaks loose, magnetized by the kick of 30 horse juice. If there was a problem, yo I'll solve it, check out my rims while my front drive revolves it, <P>Rice Rice Baby, Rice Rice Baby... <P>Yo, we outta here... E-Brake burnouts to your mother! <p>[This message has been edited by Black88GT (edited 08-16-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000022||Tigger||08-16-2001||12:54 PM||||Guess you could call mine "cheese."  I've got indy decals on my fenders, big'un "rims,"  body kit by Pontiac, and a whoop'in 4 banger to boot, ohhh boy.<P>Unlike real "cheese heads," I don't carry the "cheesy" attitude.  Because you know, it's not easy being cheesy!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 08-16-2001).]||||reg||7
