Z||000024||falconhulk||08-16-2001||02:37 PM||||What are u freakin talking about????  How is saying ricers racist?  Nobody is talking down about asians.  That term refers to people of any color race or creed that acts like an idiot.  Why would your friends be offended?  Fiero's white trash???  What are you talking about?  Who told you that?  I think you got them confused with pickup trucks.  Even that is out the window with Lincoln and Caddy making them now.  Are you trying to say all American sports cars are owned by white trash?  That site has TA's and firebirds.  What is the corvette the only upperclass sports car from the USA?  I dont use the term ricers but I understand what it means.  It means "poser".  All the cars I have seen here dont look like anything that white trash would own.  If you dont like the term just ignore it.  Dont try to prop up your argument by trying to use "Look how does it feel to be the object of racist comments when I call you white trash".  You just make yourself look bad.  I just got into Fieros and your comments made me more angry then any "ricer" comment I have seen.  I dont think a single person on this board meant any ill will towards asians.  I seriously doubt that anyone calls asians "ricers" in thier daily life.  ||||reg||1
Z||000025||Fiero_24||08-16-2001||05:19 PM||||1FST2M6, you said it well.  All these body kits and nothing under the hood.  There is a Rav 4 riced out with dual "Coffee can " mufflers.  Why would someone do that to a 4X4 (If you still call it that).  Everyone with an SI thinks they are tough stuff.  I have to admit, I am not too fond of ricers, but there are some pretty sweet ones out there that look nice.  I had one guy tell me the 4" diameter muffler was so that the turbo would not blow the motor up, but when I brought up that the exhaust is stock all the way to the muffler except for the last foot he retracted his statement.  When I say Ricer I am not refering to any nationality, just they group they belong to.  <P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||8
