Z||000038||Songman||08-17-2001||10:17 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by COUNTIBLIS:<BR><B>Im just stating that there are some people her that are redneck fuks that are prejudice and i would hate to see one of the guys i bring along whip his ass for being that way.  Im 28 years old,  I dont even car what people put on there cars, you all shouldnt either.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'm a redneck and pretty damn proud of the fact. People like you that have re-created the meaning for the term redneck are worse than anyone. Rednecks was a term that was used for men that went out and gave an honest day's work out in the hot sun so they could support their families and not have to go on 'support', as it was called back in those days. Some on this board have called them dirt farmers. These were men who would give the shirt off their backs to help a man regardless of his color. Talk about racist and prejudice. Us rednecks are the ones who have it bad just because we are proud of our heritage and don't think we owe anybody anything. <P>And bring your ricer buddies on... if they want to start something they will not only show their mentality but also bite off a little more than they can chew. Of course, people with the mentality that you are showing never do one-on-one anyway. They always have their boyz around to back them up.<P>Get over yourself. If there is any prejudice here, you are the one who brought it up. I think rednecks need some whiny ass special interest groups to take up for our rights because we are definitely discriminated against. When is the last time you heard anyone get all offended over a bubba joke?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 08-17-2001).]||||reg||8
Z||000039||COUNTIBLIS||08-17-2001||10:55 AM||||Like always,  you all have pretty much lost my point i was trying to get across. I have no rice buddies. Most of my friends drive like explorers, mountaineers, impalas, and luxury cars.  being like i said 28 years of age and work in a cooperate setting.  Therefore like I said I dont care what anyone does with their cars.  But my point i was trying to get across was this.  I have a black friend at work that has started to get into fiero with me.  He has been looking at archives and recent postings and said are these guys prejudice if so I wouldnt want to come to cinci with you and have problems start.  That was my point.  I dont care if you have a coffee can or a r type sticker or even a turbo sticker on your car.  geez.  ||||reg||1
Z||000040||COUNTIBLIS||08-17-2001||11:02 AM||||boilmaker, yes if everything is still a go i will be up there.  <P>songmaker, Im from the country actually the hills down in hazard ky,  I got away from there for a reason, i friend black be it that got tore up by about 6 rednecks back in highschool when i was younger, you wanna know how the only way he could identify who they were the next day?  By a belt buckle.  Yeah back in the day the meaning was different.  Now and days what you see on jerry springer and such is what we call rednecks. <P> ||||reg||1
Z||000041||Songman||08-17-2001||11:16 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by COUNTIBLIS:<BR><B>Like always,  you all have pretty much lost my point i was trying to get across. I have no rice buddies. Most of my friends drive like explorers, mountaineers, impalas, and luxury cars.  being like i said 28 years of age and work in a cooperate setting.  Therefore like I said I dont care what anyone does with their cars.  But my point i was trying to get across was this.  I have a black friend at work that has started to get into fiero with me.  He has been looking at archives and recent postings and said are these guys prejudice if so I wouldnt want to come to cinci with you and have problems start.  That was my point.  I dont care if you have a coffee can or a r type sticker or even a turbo sticker on your car.  geez.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sometimes ideas do get lost in words. It is a fact of life... If this latest post is really what you were thinking, it is totally different than the first one...<P>Listen... I am a Southern boy all the way to the bone. I am proud of my heritage and think I have a right to be. But I also have tons of black friends. To be totally honest with you, anyone that I know that is prejudiced is black. I'm not saying all black people are prejudice, but I am saying that a lot of them are and very vocal about it...<P>Anyway... I am 36 and spent many years in the corporate world before I got into the music business. My corporate friends got a kick out of the fact that sometime on my lunch break I would go visit my buddy at his wrecker service where I stored some of my cars and on occasion would even hop in the wrecker to go on a call with him... suit and all! Of course, a lot of the corporate 'friends' were shallow and not really friends at all...<P>Tell your buddy that as far as I am concerned he would be welcome anywhere. I think most here feel like that. And as far as all these luxury cars... remind them that they are just cars. Doesn't really change the person driving them. I have a Lexus too but enjoy my Fiero much more!<P>I could go on and on about this, but I think you see my point.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000042||BOILERMAKER||08-17-2001||11:28 AM||||Hey, COUNTBS, spelling means a lot when you are referring to someone's screen name, especially when it is spelled several times for you on the screen||||reg||1
Z||000043||falconhulk||08-17-2001||11:28 AM||||"i friend black be it that got tore up by about 6 rednecks back in highschool when i was younge"  What does this mean?  No one in this fourm has said a thing about blacks or even Asians.  You are the one that got hopped up and then changed your tune.  I understand what you mean though.  You just got carried away.  Just say so and end this never ending post mess.||||reg||1
Z||000044||Songman||08-17-2001||11:34 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by COUNTIBLIS:<BR><B>songmaker, Im from the country actually the hills down in hazard ky,  I got away from there for a reason, i friend black be it that got tore up by about 6 rednecks back in highschool when i was younger, you wanna know how the only way he could identify who they were the next day?  By a belt buckle.  Yeah back in the day the meaning was different.  Now and days what you see on jerry springer and such is what we call rednecks.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I understand that there are backwater racist assholes living in pockets of the world. But that is not the general population. I am just as much against those people as you are, or as your black friend is. <P>As I said in the other post, I have lots of black friends.. and you know what? Most of them are racist. They tolerate me because they know I am not.<P>I really honestly wish people would get over all the race stuff. I know this is not about the subject anymore but I think we are beyond it. But as long as people want 'paid back' for slavery, as long as there is Black Entertainment Television, and Black History Week, and the NAACP, and the AACP, etc, we will never be equal and racism will never disappear. Let us white folks try any of this and hear the outcry and watch the riots on TV.<P>Anyway.. I have been known to take up for people.. all people... to steal the line from TV, "Why can't we all just get along?"<P>You and your friend enjoy the show.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000045||falconhulk||08-17-2001||12:06 PM||||Hey Songman<BR>I am with ya!!  I agree totally.  i think he just got carried away and wrote somethings he should not have.  Now he is smoothing it over.||||reg||1
Z||000046||Voytek||08-17-2001||12:51 PM||||'i friend black be it that got tore up by about 6 rednecks back in highschool when i was younger'<P>COUNTIBLIS - if you spend any time in the corporate office, it's probably sweeping the floors.<P>I use the word 'ricer' and have been called a Polack many times - I DON'T get offended.  I'm 27 and would LOOOVE to take ANY of your friends on.<P>'Redneck fuks'???  You've got a lot of nerves calling people that on here.  I hope you have 'the stuff' to back that up.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000047||fieronv||08-17-2001||03:25 PM||||This whole thing with calling fiero people racist is the most ridiculous load of  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> that I've heard of (maybe a very small % are). 99% of the fiero people are the best people to hang with. As for calling people "ricers" it isn't racist it's the stupid things they do to a car (huge wings, coffee can exhaust tips, improper lowering, improper stickers). Personally I don't look at who drives the car or whether the car is domestic or import to call it a "ricer". I also think that if that's what they like so be it. Owning a car is personal choice and how you express yourself with it is also your choice. The only way that this will stop is to have every person in the country to have the same car with the same color and not be allowed to change anything on it. To me that doesn't sound very good. Countblis sometime a thick skin is good, also please use the spell check at the bottom it will make things easier for people to read and take you more seriously. <P>------------------<BR>85GT (twoloud)||||reg||8
Z||000048||Butter||08-17-2001||04:56 PM||||Countiblis,<BR>You sound like an idiot to me!  Now I'm what you call one of them there Hillbillys and I'm Damn proud of it too.  We be closely related to them there Rednecks with a little Indian throwed in there.  Bought my v8 kit from one of them there Yankees and he wus real nice to me and helpful.  Been halfway around the world and got along with everyone that had a little tolerance for people. The dead veteran's of this country died so you could say your bull$hit and they were from all decents.  You need to shuck this down a little more and get off your prejudice attitude dude.  They be a lot of things that can be implied by using the term ricer.  It can add flavor to a sight or vision to a sound.  Can you feel where I be coming from?  You shouldn't be offended by a word this implies, to me, that your an idiot.  See my picture?  Now I wouldn't want to start no flaming thread.  It's just how I feel about this Topic and all the flaming going on out here.  So you can tear into me if you want cause I be tough and seasoned.  I ain't the badest fellow out here but I'll do till he gets here.  Chill out and look at things with a more positive attitude.<P>Best Regards||||reg||8
Z||000049||2Low4U||08-17-2001||10:04 PM||||QUESTION.<BR>  Riced.<BR>Stickers, 10" Exhaust, Lowered enough to were the ground effects hit pebbles.  It's about cars not who drives them, It's these people's opinion about the cars.  Personally I think it's kinda funny when someone spends around 10k give or take a little, on an imported honda civic with a 4 banger 2.0 in it, Gets rims, lowers it a little, puts stickers on it, and welds a coffee can to the exhaust, then cruises around thinking there 2.0 can take anyone, because it has 'stickers on it'.<P> I could take a ford escort with rust holes all over it, throw a few stickers on it, and do the same thing.  It's the difference of people who actually do work to there cars to make them sound good and look good, versus those who put 10" exhaust's on there honda's and think there's are better.  If you cant understand that then this isnt a concept for you, It's nothing personal against any race or religion, it's strictly to cars, I've seen white people driving honda's that are riced out too, it's not just asian's and it isn't just limited to them either... <P>------------------<BR>If it aint low, it aint show.||||reg||3
Z||000050||Galen||08-17-2001||10:16 PM||||dun went and gawt us redneks and hillbilly folk afters ya. Best be watching out now, ya hear!<P>Yes I'm Southern(NC) and damn proud of it. and [/b]YES[/b] I am a Fiero Owner.. and even more 'damn' proud of that fact. If someone is gonna dislike me for either of them reasons, their lose not mine.<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Ray</FONT> <FONT COLOR="gray">-</FONT> <FONT COLOR="purple"><A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>Fierolinks.f2.com/</A></FONT><BR>In the event I offended you, Let me state this apology. - I am incredibly sorry for my personal views, which I am granted under united states constitution to have, offended you in anyway. If you do not accept this apology. Please by all means, tell me! -||||reg||1
