Z||000061||Predator||08-29-2001||08:43 AM||||I am from Georgia and white so I am classed as a Redneck by birthright. So what. Count, Do you even know what a Redneck is. It is not what you think. It is a person who works in the fields all day and has a red neck from the sunburn on their neck. You wear a long sleeve shirt so it looks funny with your neck being the only thing tanned. That's it. It's not from the movie Deliverance. I do pretty well so I don't live in a trailer. I have friends that do. It does not make them white trash, especially since some of them are not even white. I take it you have something against poor people now.  I do not belong to the KKK either. You seem to be the only one doing the name-calling and racist remarks here. How do you get the word Rice, and translate that to racism? You assume Rice means oriental. That is a big assumption on your part. That is like saying I eat Corn Bread so I am a Redneck. Duh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> . You and your friend need to get over yourselves.||||reg||13
